* Task 18 regression fixture: DEFINE DATA with INDEPENDENT section containing real AIV fields
* Verifies that +AIV-prefixed names (Application-Independent Variables) are extracted,
* not silently dropped. AIV names ALWAYS use the + prefix in Natural.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
1 #LOCAL-VAR (A10)
INDEPENDENT
1 +AIV-COUNTER (N5)
1 +AIV-NAME (A20)
END-DEFINE

END
